# RAYMOND v2.8 — Environment Configuration

This file serves as a template for local development. Copy to `.env` and fill in your values.

## Application
```
RAYMOND_ENV=development
DEBUG=true
LOG_LEVEL=INFO
```

## Live Trading (⚠️ DANGER ZONE)
```
# CRITICAL: This must be explicitly set to 'true' to enable live trading
# Default is 'false' — all trades are paper trading
LIVE_TRADING_ENABLED=false

# Emergency stop API key
# Required to activate emergency stop endpoint
EMERGENCY_API_KEY=your-emergency-key-here
```

## Database
```
# SQLite (default for dev)
DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///./raymond.db

# PostgreSQL (production)
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/raymond
```

## Market Data
```
# Market data provider: mock, alpha_vantage, twelve_data, alpaca, polygon
MARKET_DATA_PROVIDER=mock

# Alpha Vantage API key (for real XAUUSD data)
ALPHA_VANTAGE_API_KEY=your-alpha-vantage-key-here

# Twelve Data API key
TWELVE_DATA_API_KEY=your-twelve-data-key-here

# Alpaca API key
ALPACA_API_KEY=your-alpaca-key-here
ALPACA_SECRET_KEY=your-alpaca-secret-key-here

# Polygon.io API key
POLYGON_API_KEY=your-polygon-key-here
```

## Broker Connections
```
# MetaTrader 5 (MT5)
MT5_LOGIN=your-mt5-login
MT5_PASSWORD=your-mt5-password
MT5_SERVER=MT5-Demo  # or your broker's server name
MT5_ACCOUNT_TYPE=demo  # or live

# Exness
EXNESS_TOKEN=your-exness-api-token
EXNESS_ACCOUNT_ID=your-exness-account-id
EXNESS_ACCOUNT_TYPE=demo  # or live
```

## API Authentication
```
# API key for admin endpoints
ADMIN_API_KEY=your-admin-api-key-here

# JWT secret for token authentication
JWT_SECRET=your-jwt-secret-key-here
JWT_ALGORITHM=HS256
JWT_EXPIRATION_HOURS=24
```

## Flutter Dashboard (Android)
```
# Backend API endpoint
BACKEND_API_URL=http://localhost:8000
BACKEND_WS_URL=ws://localhost:8000

# Dashboard authentication
DASHBOARD_API_KEY=your-dashboard-key-here
```

## Logging & Monitoring
```
# Log file location
LOG_FILE=logs/raymond.log
LOG_MAX_BYTES=10485760  # 10MB
LOG_BACKUP_COUNT=5

# Sentry error tracking (optional)
SENTRY_DSN=https://your-sentry-dsn-here

# Datadog monitoring (optional)
DATADOG_API_KEY=your-datadog-key-here
DATADOG_APP_KEY=your-datadog-app-key-here
```

## Redis (optional, for caching)
```
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379
REDIS_DB=0
```

## CORS Settings
```
# Allowed origins for CORS
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000,http://localhost:8080,http://localhost:5000
```

## Alerts & Notifications
```
# Email for alerts
ALERT_EMAIL=your-email@example.com
SMTP_SERVER=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USERNAME=your-email@gmail.com
SMTP_PASSWORD=your-app-password

# Slack webhook for emergency alerts
SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL=https://hooks.slack.com/services/YOUR/WEBHOOK/URL
```

## Risk Management Thresholds
```
# Daily loss limit (in USD)
MAX_DAILY_LOSS=500.0

# Max risk per position (%)
MAX_RISK_PER_POSITION=2.0

# Max total portfolio risk (%)
MAX_PORTFOLIO_RISK=5.0

# Position size limit (in lots)
MAX_POSITION_SIZE=1.0
```

## Backtest Parameters
```
# Initial capital for backtesting
BACKTEST_INITIAL_BALANCE=10000.0

# Commission per trade (in USD)
BACKTEST_COMMISSION=10.0
```

---

### Security Notes
- ⚠️ **NEVER** commit `.env` to version control
- ⚠️ **NEVER** hardcode API keys or passwords
- 🔒 Store production secrets in GitHub Secrets or a vault
- 🔒 Use environment variables for all sensitive data
- 🔒 Rotate API keys regularly
